9 {  font-family: var(--docx-majorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 28.00pt;  font-size: 28.00pt;}span.docx_a9 p {  margin-bottom: 4.00pt;  text-align: center;  text-indent: 10.00pt;}span.docx_a9 {  font-family: var(--docx-majorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 28.00pt;  font-size: 28.00pt;}p.docx_aa {  margin-bottom: 8.00pt;  text-indent: 10.00pt;  text-align: center;}p.docx_aa span {  font-family: var(--docx-majorHAnsi-font);  color: #595959;  min-height: 14.00pt;  font-size: 14.00pt;}p.docx_aa span {  font-family: var(--docx-majorHAnsi-font);  color: #595959;  min-height: 14.00pt;  font-size: 14.00pt;}span.docx_ab {  font-family: var(--docx-majorHAnsi-font);  color: #595959;  min-height: 14.00pt;  font-size: 14.00pt;}span.docx_ab p {  margin-bottom: 8.00pt;  text-indent: 10.00pt;  text-align: center;}span.docx_ab {  font-family: var(--docx-majorHAnsi-font);  color: #595959;  min-height: 14.00pt;  font-size: 14.00pt;}p.docx_ac {  margin-top: 8.00pt;  margin-bottom: 8.00pt;  text-align: center;  text-indent: 10.00pt;}p.docx_ac span {  font-style: italic;  color: #404040;  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;}p.docx_ac span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  font-style: italic;  color: #404040;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;}span.docx_ad {  font-family: Times New Roman;  font-style: italic;  color: #404040;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;}span.docx_ad p {  margin-top: 8.00pt;  margin-bottom: 8.00pt;  text-align: center;  text-indent: 10.00pt;}span.docx_ad {  font-style: italic;  color: #404040;  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;}p.docx_ae {  margin-left: 36.00pt;  text-indent: 10.00pt;  text-align: justify;}p.docx_ae span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;}span.docx_af {  font-style: italic;  color: #0F4761;}p.docx_af0 {  border-top: 0.50pt solid #0F4761;  border-bottom: 0.50pt solid #0F4761;  margin-top: 18.00pt;  margin-bottom: 18.00pt;  margin-left: 43.20pt;  margin-right: 43.20pt;  text-align: center;  text-indent: 10.00pt;}p.docx_af0 span {  font-style: italic;  color: #0F4761;  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;}p.docx_af0 span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  font-style: italic;  color: #0F4761;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;}span.docx_af1 {  font-family: Times New Roman;  font-style: italic;  color: #0F4761;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;}span.docx_af1 p {  border-top: 0.50pt solid #0F4761;  border-bottom: 0.50pt solid #0F4761;  margin-top: 18.00pt;  margin-bottom: 18.00pt;  margin-left: 43.20pt;  margin-right: 43.20pt;  text-align: center;  text-indent: 10.00pt;}span.docx_af1 {  font-style: italic;  color: #0F4761;  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 16.00pt;  font-size: 16.00pt;}span.docx_af2 {  font-weight: bold;  text-transform: lowercase;  color: #0F4761;}p.docx_af3 {  margin-top: 5.00pt;  margin-bottom: 5.00pt;  text-indent: 0.00pt;  text-align: left;}p.docx_af3 span {  font-family: 宋体;  min-height: 12.00pt;  font-size: 12.00pt;}p.docx_af4 {  text-align: left;  text-indent: 10.00pt;}p.docx_af4 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}p.docx_af4 span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_af5 {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_af5 p {  text-align: left;  text-indent: 10.00pt;}span.docx_af5 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}</style><section class="docx"><header><p class="docx_a6" style="text-indent: 18pt;"><br></p></header><article><p class="docx_a3" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">在西安电子科技大学的课堂上，没有枯燥的理论堆砌，只有满屏的创意迸发：有人把电路设计藏进星球造型的台灯里，有人用代码复刻出童年记忆里的复古游戏机，还有人让AI帮着设计会发光的蝴蝶……这些让人眼前一亮的“作品”，都来自空间科学与技术学院谢楷老师主持的“电子信息STEM项目”课程——一门把创意美学、3D打印、电路设计揉进“造物工程”的硬核课。</p><p class="docx_1" style="text-indent: 0pt;">为什么要建“融合式课程”？AI时代的工科教学，要破这4个难题<span style="font-family: &quot;MS Gothic&quot;;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">随着AI技术飞速发展，传统工科教学逐渐遇到了“瓶颈”：<span style="font-family: &quot;MS Gothic&quot;;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">1.学分、课时一减再减，单门课知识点都讲不完，更别提串联应用；<span style="font-family: &quot;MS Gothic&quot;;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">2.不少“拼接课”效果打折扣，比如模电+数电的融合实践，总达不到预期效果；<span style="font-family: &quot;MS Gothic&quot;;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">3.知识爆炸时代，课程体系又杂又散，学生缺乏系统性的“电子工程通识”打底；<span style="font-family: &quot;MS Gothic&quot;;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">4.一对一“导师制”没抓手，最后容易流于形式。<span style="font-family: &quot;MS Gothic&quot;;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">为了破解这些问题，谢楷老师团队瞄准STEM教育理念——把原先独立科学（Science）、技术（Technology）、工程（Engineering）、数学（Mathematics）“拧成一股绳”，打造出了这门“融合式课程”，让工科学习从“碎片化”走向“系统化”。</p><p class="docx_1" style="text-indent: 0pt;">这门课有多“融合”？10+门课程知识点打包，带来4大改变<span style="font-family: &quot;MS Gothic&quot;;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">不同于传统课程“一门课讲一类知识”，这门STEM课程直接“拆墙重组”：把微机原理、计算机制图、高级语言程序设计、AI应用等10多门课的核心内容，重新整合进“造物”全流程。最终，课程改革为人才培养体系带来了四个关键变化：<span style="font-family: &quot;MS Gothic&quot;;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">1.核心课“少而精”：电类课程恢复64学时，不再追求“广而浅”，而是把重点内容讲透、讲深、让学生学精；<span style="font-family: &quot;MS Gothic&quot;;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">2.基础课“集大成”：不止科学、数学、技术、工程，还加入了艺术设计，让工科生的作品既有“技术含量”，又有“颜值担当”；<span style="font-family: &quot;MS Gothic&quot;;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">3.综合实践“实战化”：不搞“纸上谈兵”，所有实践都紧扣真实场景，突出系统性和专业特色；<span style="font-family: &quot;MS Gothic&quot;;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">4.实践体系“系统化”：从小组协作到项目落地，全程培养学生的团队意识和系统工程能力。</p><p class="docx_1" style="text-indent: 0pt;">2025年试点开课！20人导师组“轮班授课”，课时安排藏巧思</p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">今年，“电子信息STEM项目”课程率先在电子信息大类和钱学森班试点，光是授课模式就足够“新鲜”：</p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">谢楷老师牵头组建了20人左右的导师组，涵盖电路、结构、机电、通信、美术、软件等多个领域，每次上课根据内容灵活搭配5人“导师组”，确保每个知识点都有“专家级”指导。</p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">课时安排更是精准踩中“学习节奏”：30分钟集中授课+2小时小组研讨+1.5小时项目创意设计，一步步引导学生从“知道理论”到“做出产品”，真正实现“学以致用”。</p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">值得一提的是，谢楷老师还把课程实践的精华整理成了《造物工程》教材，目前已经交付出版，仅校内就预定了750多本，不少学生直呼“等不及想入手”！</p><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 442.2pt; height: 183pt;"><img src="/__local/0/8A/4A/8AA23AB2474A36BDF993047E5B7_CE850208_22D81.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/08A4A8AA23AB2474A36BDF993047E5B7/CE850208/22D81" vheight=" 183pt" vwidth=" 442.2pt" orisrc="/__local/3/EF/B8/03DCAB76866972C2B9914314BFE_9EA71F6B_47C1B.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 442.2pt; height: 183pt;"></span></p><p class="docx_1" style="text-indent: 0pt;">学生成果太惊艳！从创意到产品，全链条实践“玩”转新工科</p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">这门课的最终目标，是让学生打通“从创意到电路再到产品”的全流程。看看同学们的作品，就知道效果有多好：</p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">案例1：能“触摸”的创意灯具</p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">3-5人一组，不仅要实现“灯”的基础功能，还要加入“触摸感应”的技术亮点，更要兼顾造型的艺术感。课程最后，还专门组织了作品展示会，每个小组上台讲解设计思路，现场俨然一场“工科创意展”。</p><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 442.2pt; height: 217.35pt;"><img src="/__local/6/85/DE/9E1AE56B5F542A46DB8D9A10DB8_E053A429_9C70B.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/685DE9E1AE56B5F542A46DB8D9A10DB8/E053A429/9C70B" vheight=" 217.35pt" vwidth=" 442.2pt" orisrc="/__local/4/1E/9B/C3E74D3219A0FB7EE28A1AE1CBB_462A6431_2305C0.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 442.2pt; height: 217.35pt;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">案例2：AI助力的发光蝴蝶</p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">课程引入AI设计助手，助力电路辅助设计和AI排错，一路顺畅打通“电路设计—实物制作—功能实现”的全链条。</p><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 442.2pt; height: 227.7pt;"><img src="/__local/E/C8/06/AE6004F9090355AAE9ABDD40FC6_F4F46A30_8F592.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/EC806AE6004F9090355AAE9ABDD40FC6/F4F46A30/8F592" vheight=" 227.7pt" vwidth=" 442.2pt" orisrc="/__local/5/0C/BB/8FB77900A6449F758A45AA74407_105B36C1_1E036F.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 442.2pt; height: 227.7pt;"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">案例3：自主设计的复古游戏机</p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;">同学们瞄准“童年回忆”，自主设计并制造了复古游戏机：从电路焊接到程序编写，再到外壳的3D打印，全程亲手完成，最后成功玩上自己做的游戏，成就感直接拉满！</p><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;"><span style="background-color: yellow;"></span></p><p style="text-align:center"><script name="_videourl" vurl="/__local/D/99/1F/956718081FD8D82D405A09BEF6D_7093AF9B_172602F.mp4?e=.mp4" vwidth="500" vheight="300" rand="null" align="" vsbhrefname="vurl" style="float:none">showVsbVideo("/__local/D/99/1F/956718081FD8D82D405A09BEF6D_7093AF9B_172602F.mp4?e=.mp4","height=\"300\"","width=\"500\"","","float:none","false");</script></p><p style="text-align:center"><script name="_videourl" vurl="/__local/0/76/A7/B1E8919A7D6AEC54D32F700AB9C_B62A5D0D_14C3E47.mp4?e=.mp4" vwidth="500" vheight="300" rand="null" align="" vsbhrefname="vurl" style="float:none">showVsbVideo("/__local/0/76/A7/B1E8919A7D6AEC54D32F700AB9C_B62A5D0D_14C3E47.mp4?e=.mp4","height=\"300\"","width=\"500\"","","float:none","false");</script></p></article><footer><p class="docx_af4" style="text-indent: 28pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">— </span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> —</span></p></footer></section>
